<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">- Tsishingini (tsw)</book>
  <para style="h">Malaci</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malaci</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malaci</para>
  <para style="mt2">Malaci</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malaci</para>
  <para style="ip">Urevu wa ala a nda Malaci a̱ yi ɗa za vi ikaka i va̱. A ɗana ta̱ Aatagada a nda a'wan ukpaku kupoton (500) kafu limatan va̱ Yesu, cina o koto usaa wa̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima. A̱ba̱jini e ikaka i vumava̱sula̱'a̱ a̱ yi ɗa ɗewu nan ganu oɓolo na ama a Isra'ila wira̱ uta̱ a na a lapula a̱ɓula̱ e le na̱ nzuwulai nle na̱ A̱sula̱. A mantsa mo ndolo ma ɗa wuma u nan ganu na ama a Isra'ila suru u yuwan una̱ta̱ nu uritosu wa̱ Musa shi. A̱ shi ta̱ paalasa A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ a̱ re vu casu le na ntsayi na̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Danshi na la'ai ucira a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda a̱yi ɗa &lt;&lt;Urana wa̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt; A̱tsuma̱ o urana u ndolo, A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ u yuwan uge'etosu reve waru wo o'woto ama a̱ yi cece. Amma kafu ili i nda i fara, u ta̱ lyungu na̱ za vi ikaka ya̱ yi na woo foɓo ure, na waru wa yuwan adanshi a nzuwulai ma̱ A̱sula̱.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="io1">Nusu va aza a Isra'ila 1:1-2:16</para>
  <para style="io1">Uge'etosu wa̱ A̱sulazuva nu urocosu wi iliyali ya̱ yi 2:17-4:6.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 1:1" />A̱yi nda a̱ yi ɗa ikaka i na A̱sulazuva a dammai aza a Isra'ila diga o una̱ u vumava̱sula̱ Malaci.<verse eid="MAL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva a ciga ta̱ Yakubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 1:2" />&lt;&lt;Reve A̱sulazuva a damma, n ta̱ e icigi i ɗu mantsa suru.&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:13">Rom 9:13</ref>.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Ish 34:5-17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">63:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:7-22">Irm 48:7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Izk 25:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Emo 1:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:2">&lt;&lt;Amma a̱vu i yuwan yeci i damma, &lt;Cine tsu ɗa vu ri e icigi i tsu?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:2">&lt;&lt;Reve a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ usu u damma, &lt;Ashe! Isuwa mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma Yakubu ɗa shi?&gt; &gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;Na̱ ne suru n ciga ta̱ Yakubu, <verse eid="MAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 1:3" />amma n 'yuwan ta̱ Isuwa. Reve n zuwa upasu wu nsasan ma̱ yi mo o'wo okongo, waru uba̱ta̱ wa agadu a̱ yi o o'wo uba̱ta̱ wu nden n musa̱n yu una.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAL 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 1:4" />Ko na wo o'woi a̱za̱ a̱ Edom a̱ shi ta̱ ɗe a damma, &lt;&lt;O kototo tsu ta̱, na̱ ne suru tsu ta suwisa okongo'o,&gt;&gt; Amma a̱vu A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a damma, &lt;&lt;Ee, a ta gura suwisa yi, amma n ta̱ ɓuɓoso yi, hali she na̱ e ɗe le iɗa yi iwuya, ama a na upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva aa jima aci e le.<verse eid="MAL 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 1:5" />&lt;&lt;I te ene ili i ndolo ne esu a̱ɗu reve i damma, &lt;A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ na̱ tsugbain, tsugbain tsa̱ yi tsa̱ ka̱ra̱ ta̱ ukosu wi iɗa ya aza a Isra'ila!&gt;<verse eid="MAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kucci vi idaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 1:6" />&lt;&lt;Mawun ma tsu yuwan ta̱ tsutoni na̱ dada va̱ yi, ne ɗa fo aagbashi aa yuwusan tsutoni na̱ zagbain va̱ yi. To, na̱ a̱mu dada ɗa a te ɗa gba tsugbain tsa̱ va̱? Na̱ a̱mu fo zagbain ɗa a te ɗa tsugbain tsa̱ va̱?&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;A̱ɗu nan ganu a na i kuɗa̱i a tara Ala a̱ va̱ ili i ro, i damma ta̱, &lt;Cine tsu ɗa, tsu kuɗa̱i a tara Ala a̱ wu ili i ro?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 1:7" />&lt;&lt;I ta casu ilyalya yi idaba zuva masa'a ma̱ va̱, a̱vu i damma, &lt;Cine tsa ɗa tso o'wotoi masa'a ma̱ wu idaba?&gt; &gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;To, n ta damma ɗu, Cine i kuɗa̱i a tara apada a̱ va̱ ili i ro. <verse eid="MAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 1:8" />Mantsa ma na i ta̱wa̱yi na̱ nama na ri irumba̱ adama i ca kucci, ashe iwuya i ɗa o ndolo'o shi? Waru mantsa ma na i ta̱wa̱yi na̱ nama na ri a̱kutsuma̱ ko za na ri ubanakun a̱yi ndolo iwuya i ɗa shi? I rito ca le ne'e e ekere a gwamna ɗu yee ene! Ko u ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ a̱ɗu, reve i tsura̱ isa'ani ekere a̱ yi? Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai.&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:19-20">N.Gn 22:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:21">U.Wl 15:21</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 1:9" />&lt;&lt;To, gogo nan ganu i rito zami urewesu wa̱ A̱sula̱ u roco tsu isa'ani. Na̱ cu'un kucci nda e ekere a̱ɗu a ɗa wa̱ usu u ɗu?&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. <verse eid="MAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 1:10" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ shi a damma nanza a̱tsuma̱ a̱ɗu a̱ shi ta̱ ɓa̱ru na̱ntsu va̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa, adama she i daɓa akina a masa'a ma̱ va̱ pere wan! Ma uwwusa uyo'o u ɗu shi,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;Waru ma̱a̱ ushi kucci diga e ekere ɗu shi. <verse eid="MAL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 1:11" />Adama a na diga a̱ ma̱ɓa̱tsa̱a̱ mo urana hali uriyu wa̱ yi, Ala a̱ va̱ a̱ ta̱ na̱ tsugbain a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa. Uba̱ta̱ suru a̱ tsu kula̱to ta̱ a̱tsuka̱ a̱ ma̱guru na̱ kucci sa'ani adama Ala a̱ va̱, adama a na Ala a̱ va̱ a̱ ta̱ na̱ tsugbain a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. <verse eid="MAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 1:12" />&lt;&lt;Amma a̱vu i 'yuwan a tara Ala a̱ va̱ ili i ro, na i dammai masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva &lt;Ili i ro i ɗa shi,&gt; waru ilyalya i na a tsu zuwusa zuva va̱ yi &lt;Ili ro i ɗa shi.&gt; <verse eid="MAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 1:13" />Agba a̱ yi ɗa nda i dammai, &lt;Tsu kuna̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a nda'a,&gt; Waru i ta uwwusa mu a̱ vunu!&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;I ta̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ ni ili i na i usai nu ucira, ko ili i na i ri a̱kutsuma̱, ko ili i na i ri ubanakun, waru e le nda ele ɗa i ta̱wa̱yi kucci ɗu! Gogo a̱ɗu i ta majiyan ma na ma̱a̱ ushi ili i nda diga ekere a̱ɗu ɗa?&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="MAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 1:14" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u ta̱ reme za yipalishi na ri na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a sa'ani a̱tsuma̱ oɓolo e ikyon ya̱ yi, za na u yuwain nzuwulai n na waa ca A̱sulazuva, amma na ne suru reve u ca kucci va̱ a̱a̱giri'i a na ri gbaga shi! Ko na wo o'woi i reve ta̱ a na a̱mu mogono ma gbain ma ɗa,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;hali na nɗa suru a uwwusa wovon wa Ala a̱ va̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAL 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAL 2" />
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva a ɓara ta̱ nan Ganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 2:1" />&lt;&lt; Gogo gba, a̱ɗu nan Ganu udammu u nda adama a̱ɗu a ɗa. <verse eid="MAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 2:2" />Ni i 'yuwan a poloo mu atsuvu, waru ni i 'yuwan o foɓo okolo a̱ɗu i ca ala a̱ va̱ tsugbain shi.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;To, n ta̱ lyungu na̱ mɓa̱la̱ aci a̱ ɗu, reve n yuwaan aba'un a̱ɗu una̱. Ee, n yuwaan le ta̱ ɗe una̱, adama a na i zuwa okolo a̱ ɗu i ca mu tsugbain shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 2:3" />&lt;&lt;Agba a̱ yi ɗa nda, n ta ɓara limatan ɗu, reve n tsuwa̱a̱n ɗu a̱ya̱n e inama i na i ta̱wa̱yi kucci o urewesu u ɗu, a̱vu mu uta̱ ɗu oɓolo na̱ a̱ya̱'a̱n. <verse eid="MAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 2:4" />Ne ɗa yee reve a na a̱mu ɗa n lyunguyi nu udammu u nda a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ a̱ ɗu, adama n shiton nzuwulai n va̱ nu ugundo wa̱ Levi,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:11-13">Mkc 3:11-13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 2:5" />&lt;&lt;Nzuwulai n va̱ na̱ yi nzuwulai n wuma u ɗa na̱ nden ma asuvu, zana n ca niyi, a̱ yi nda gba adama wu uwwa wovon u va̱ u ɗa. Waru wu uwwa ta̱ wovon u va̱, reve u ca ala a̱ va̱ tsugbain.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:12">Mkc 25:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 2:6" />Uritosu wa amayun u ta̱ o una̱ wa̱ yi, waru aa cina epen o una̱ wa̱ yi shi. U yuwan ta̱ mmalu oɓolo na̱ a̱mu a̱tsuma̱ asuvu nden na̱ mejege, reve u zuwa ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a vadala a lyawa iwuya i le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 2:7" />&lt;&lt;Adama a na ulobono ta̱ una̱ wa Ganu u da̱na̱ nu urevu, waru ama a zami udammu diga o una̱ wa̱ yi, adama a na a̱ yi malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa. <verse eid="MAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 2:8" />Amma a̱vu a̱ɗu nan ganu i lyawa ure, hali i zuwa ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ a̱tsuma̱ o uritosu u ɗu, a̱vu i kuɗa akucunu a na n yuwain na̱ Levi,&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. <verse eid="MAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 2:9" />&lt;&lt;Adama o ndolo a̱mu na aciya̱va̱ n ta zuwa ama a Isra'ila a tara ɗu ili i ro wan, reve fo n zuwa a̱ ka̱ɗa̱to ɗu elime a ama suru, adama a na i yuwan tsutoni na̱ re va̱ shi, agba a̱ yi ɗa nda a̱tsuma̱ o uritosu u ɗu yoo rocosu aɗangulu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAL 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ a Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 2:10" />Ashe dada ta̱ ɗa tsu shi? Ashe A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱ a ɗa a yuwan tsu shi? Adama a̱ nye tsu ri nu ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱, hali na tsu kuɗa̱i a tara nzuwulai mu nkaya n tsu ili i ro? <verse eid="MAL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 2:11" />Ama a Yahuda a yuwan ta̱ ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱, a yuwan ta̱ ili yi idaba a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila na̱ Urishelima. Adama a na Yahuda vari ta̱ Uba̱ta̱ wu Nde wa Akiza wa̱ A̱sulazuva, za na u cigai, a̱vu a zuwa a̱ma̱ci a na aa yuwusaan ma̱sula̱ mo ro a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="MAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 2:12" />Vuma na yuwain cu'un ndolo suru, ko na̱ shi a̱yi ɗa yan, lyawa A̱sulazuva o kototo yi na̱ limatan va̱ yi diga a̱tsuma̱ a ama a Isra'ila, ko na̱ shi u ta̱wa̱a̱ ɗe na̱ kucci uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva.<verse eid="MAL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 2:13" />Apa ili i ro i na yaa yuwusan. I re'weto ta̱ masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva na aɓara na̱ mesun na̱ wa̱ɗyosu adama a na u da̱shi u ushi kucci ɗu nu une'e wo okolo a̱ ta̱ a̱ ɗu diga ekere a̱ ɗu shi. <verse eid="MAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 2:14" />Amma i ta yuwusan yeci ana, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai u 'yuwain kucci tsu?&gt;&gt; Ashe, A̱sulazuva lyusu ɗa e ekere a̱ wu na̱ ka va̱ wu na vu zuwai a̱vu o ulobo, za na vu yuwayin ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ shi, ko na wo o'woi ka va̱ wu ɗa na vu yuwain akucunu o lolo na̱ yi.<verse eid="MAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 2:15" />Ashe, A̱sulazuva a ɗa a zuwa nɗu yo o'wo lipu ta̱ na̱ ruhu ta̱ shi? Nye i zuwai A̱sula̱ a yuwain ne? U ta zama adama muwun ntsu n da̱na̱ na̱ cu'un wuma wa̱ yi. Adama o ndolo gba, she yi idana aciya̱ɗu, she za a̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu kuɗa̱ da̱na̱ nu ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere a ka tsulobo tsa̱ yi wan. <verse eid="MAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 2:16" />&lt;&lt;Adama a na n 'yuwan ta̱ wukasu u lolo,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a̱ A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila a dammai. &lt;&lt;Agba n ta 'yuwusan ili i nda cine n 'yuwain u'ya̱susa̱n wu ugɓozu. Adama o ndolo she yi idana aciya̱ɗu, adama ta̱wa̱ yo o'wo a̱za̱ o ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ wan.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai.<verse eid="MAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 2:17" />I ta damatosun A̱sulazuva na adanshi a̱ɗu, agba yeci ta̱, &lt;&lt;Cine tsu ɗa tsa damatosun yi?&gt;&gt; Ana ya dansa, &lt;&lt;Za na suru yuwain iwuya a̱yi ɗa za va̱ a̱ɓula̱ o urewesu wa̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt; I ta̱ waru e ecishe,&lt;&lt;Te ɗa A̱sula̱ a na a yuwusan uge'etosu u mejege?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAL 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Urana wu uge'etosu u ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 3:1" />&lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱, a̱yi ɗa nda n ri gan na ma̱a̱ lyungu na̱ malingata ma̱ va̱, adama a na woo foɓoo mu ure, waru babu a̱ ɗu urevu A̱sulazuva a na yaa zama u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ yi. Malingata ma nzuwulai ma na i jimai e ipiri, na amayun u ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:10">Mat 11:10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:2">Mak 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:76">Luk 1:76</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:27">7:27</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 3:2" />Amma za ne ɗa a gura kaɓa asuvu o urana u na wa̱ ta̱wa̱, waru za ne ɗa a gura e isawan a mantsa ma na u rocoyi aciya̱yi? Adama a na a̱ yi u ta̱ tsa akina a na a̱ tsu jeruweto rumu, waru tsa̱ a̱zuma̱'a̱ a̱ lima̱.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:11">Juw 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:17">Wen 6:17</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 3:3" />U ta̱ da̱nu u yuwan uge'etosu tsa za na tsu jeruweto azurufa a̱vu u ka̱mba̱to yi cece. A̱yi ɗa wa̱a̱ ka̱mba̱to ugundo wa̱ Levi cece a̱vu wu jeruweto le tsa̱ zinariya na̱ azurufa, hali na a ca kucci le uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ a̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="MAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 3:4" />Ɗaɗa kucci va aza a Yahuda na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Urishelima o o'wo ili yu u ushishi uba̱ta̱ A̱sulazuva tsa rana na ka̱ra̱i ɗe, waru tsa a'wan a na a̱ ka̱ra̱i. <verse eid="MAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 3:5" />&lt;&lt;Ɗaɗa ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ zuzu na̱ a̱ɗu adama n yuwan uge'etosu. N ta̱ gba o'wo esu a aci o oboci na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ tsipere, na aza a na a yuwusan akucunu epen, na aza a na a tsutsugbusa melen ma aza azamalinga, na aza a na a palusa nra̱na̱ na̱ mkpa'an, na aza a na a̱ gba̱rusa̱ omocin, ele aza a na a uwwusa wovon u va̱ shi.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai.<verse eid="MAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ucasu wu za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 3:6" />&lt;&lt;A̱mu A̱sulazuva n tsu vadala okolo a̱ va̱ shi. Adama o ndolo, a̱ɗu ugundo wa Yakubu, o kototo ɗu suru suru shi. <verse eid="MAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 3:7" />Diga a mantsa ma nkaya nɗu i lyawa ta̱ o tonishi udammu u va̱, waru i yuwan tsutoni ne e le shi. I ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ u va̱, a̱mu fo n ta̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ u ɗu,&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;Amma a̱vu i damma, &lt;Cine tsu ɗa tsa̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 3:8" />&lt;&lt;Vuma ta gura yuwan A̱sula̱ a'usa? Na̱ ne suru i yuwan mu ta̱ a'usa!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 3:8">&lt;&lt;Amma a̱vu i damma, &lt;Cine tsu yuwan nuwu a'usa?&gt; &gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Uba̱ta̱ wu za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ kupa ɗu nu ucasu wi itana ya̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ɗu na̱ za vi iliyamunga i ɗu, oɓolo na a ɗa o ucasu wo okolo a̱ ta̱ a̱ ɗu! <verse eid="MAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 3:9" />Una̱ u ta aci a̱ ɗu, a̱ɗu iɗa suru, adama a na i ta yuwusan mu a'usa! <verse eid="MAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 3:10" />Ta̱wa̱yi na̱ kucci ɗu suru o u'wa wu uzuwa, adama a̱ tsura̱ ilyalya a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa u va̱. Lyungwa̱ numu a̱tsuma̱ e ili ya nda,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;ko ma̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ na̱ntsu va zuva reve n tsuwa̱n ɗu aba'un a̱ a̱bunda̱ zana ya̱ tsura̱ asula a na ya̱ tsun le shi.&gt;&gt; <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:6">N.Gn 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:21-24">Mkc 18:21-24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:6">U.Wl 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:22-29">14:22-29</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:12">Neh 13:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 3:11" />&lt;&lt;N te geshe ili i tsu'yan adama she a̱ lungusa̱ itana ya̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ɗu wan, waru ataci a̱ɗuma̱ ɗu oo oco muwun n le shi,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. <verse eid="MAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 3:12" />&lt;&lt;Reve nɗa suru n ɗe ɗu aza aba'un, adama a na iɗa i ɗu i to o'wo iɗa yu uyo'o wu nde.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai.<verse eid="MAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱za̱ a̱ɓula̱ a na a lyuwa a aci o urana wa̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 3:13" />&lt;&lt;I damma ta̱ iwuya a aci a̱ va̱,&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;Na̱ ne suru yee ece ta̱, &lt;Nye ɗa tsu dammai a aci a̱ wu?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 3:14" />&lt;&lt;I ta dansa, &lt;Ili ya̱ pere iɗa a yuwaan A̱sula̱ a̱ga̱nda̱. Uda̱shiwu u ne ɗa tsa̱ tsura̱ na̱ tsu yuwan tsutoni na adanshi a̱yi, ko a damma tsu ka̱ra̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ elime A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva o rocosu a̱tsumola̱ngu? <verse eid="MAL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 3:15" />Agba gogo tsu te e nda aza aciyogbamu e le ɗa aza aba'un, hali gba na aza a na aa yuwusan iwuya ulyuwu we elime a ɗa goon a̱ tsura̱sa̱ shi, amma a̱ tsu lyungwa̱ ta̱ A̱sula̱ reve a̱ da̱nu gbaga.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 3:16" />Reve aza a na a uwwusa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva a yuwan n dammulai, a̱vu A̱sulazuva o polo atsuvu reve wu uwwa le. A ɗana ta̱ aatagada o ucuwusan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi adama aza a na a uwwusa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva, waru aa yuwusan majiyan ma Ala a̱ yi. <verse eid="MAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 3:17" />&lt;&lt;O to o'wo a̱za̱ a̱ va̱,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;O to o'wo ama a sa'ani a̱ va̱ o urana u na n foɓoi, n ta̱ gba ene iliyali i le ununa vuma tse ene iliyali i mawun ma̱ yi za na tsu yuwusaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="MAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAL 3:18" />Ɗaɗa gba ya̱a̱ da̱shi ene na a̱za̱ a̱ɓula̱ na̱ a̱za̱ e iwuya a̱ ri una̱ta̱ shi, na aza a na a yuwusaan A̱sula̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ na aza a na a yuwusaan yi shi.<verse eid="MAL 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAL 4" />
  <para style="s">Urana wa̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 4:1" />&lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱, na amayun urana u ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱, tsa akina o uruma, a na aza aciyogbamu suru na̱ a̱za̱ e iwuya a̱ kula̱ tso ogozo o u'yewu. Urana u na u ri lo a̱ ta̱wa̱ u ta̱ lyuwa le suru,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;Diga a aralu a̱ tyo eten, ili yi lo na a lyawaa le shi. <verse eid="MAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 4:2" />Amma a̱ɗu na ya yuwusan mu tsutoni, ucira wi iwawi i va̱ u ta̱ uta̱ ɗu tsu urana. U ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ɗu no opocino tse e ekan yu urana. Waru i to uta̱ a tsu'yan tsa̱ mudindim n na a̱ ba̱ɗa̱i diga a̱tsuma̱ oɓolo e inan. <verse eid="MAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 4:3" />A̱tsuma̱ o urana u na n foɓoi, i ta dadasa a̱za̱ e iwuya, adama a na o to o'wo okomo za̱la̱ va ana a̱ɗu. Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAL 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 4:4" />&lt;&lt;I cuwan nu uritosu wa aagbashi a̱ va̱ Musa, ni ili i na n zuwai na̱ a̱ kuru na̱ wila̱ nu udammu u na n ca niyi ɗe Horeb adama aza a Isra'ila suru a̱ kuru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 4:5" />&lt;&lt;Agba a̱yi ɗa nda n ta̱ lyunguwa̱a̱ ɗu na̱ vumava̱sula̱ Iliya, kafu urana u gbain urana u wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11:14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">17:10-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:11-13">Mak 9:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:17">Luk 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:21">Yah 1:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 4:6" />U ta vadala okolo a mbara a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u muwun nle, waru okolo a̱ muwun a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wu mbara nle, adama she n ta̱wa̱ n faba iɗa nu ukototosu wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAL 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 4" />
</usx>